Keep Isocast's settings and state in the XDG folders on Linux.

Upstream keeps everything in $XDG_DATA_HOME/isocast.  Settings (the setup
file, the scene collections and profiles beside it, their setup.*.json
companions, the app's layout and the remote-control client settings) go
to $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/isocast, and logs and the install id to
$XDG_STATE_HOME/isocast.  Plugins stay in $XDG_DATA_HOME/isocast; a
~/.isocast from earlier builds is still used for everything.

